      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The standard 3-step progressive discipline process typically involves: (1) Verbal Warning, where you address the underperforming employee directly to express concerns and expectations, and outline necessary improvements; (2) Written Warning, which documents the verbal warning and provides specific details regarding performance issues and expected changes; and (3) Disciplinary Action, such as a suspension or termination, if the performance issues persist despite previous warnings.",
